[Trigger]
Name	openingRound
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	The halls under Lanternhill twist like a knot, and the old keepers filled every corner with traps. Possess a creature of your own, walk it through the maze and find the exit hall before the lamps burn out.
Action	objective	1	Bring a creature to the exit hall in the north-east before time runs out.
Action	timelimit	900
Action	reveal	1	ExitHall
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	moatTwo
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Between
Action	message	1	The second moat has a span of its own. It slides out of the wall as you approach.
Action	terrain	44	18	44	18	bridge	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	leverFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Lever
Action	message	1	Something in the stone shifts. Far away, a seal has opened.
Action	terrain	50	6	50	6	path
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hallReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	ExitHall
Action	message	1	The exit hall is yours, and the heart gives you a shard for the way you walked.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
